@@text Needs the Creative Delight jar nesting babyMobs 1.1.0 (built 2026-11-01, not yet installed). The remodels are client
@@text rendering only; the server half checks that nothing client-side loads on a dedicated server. BM-03 to BM-09 of
@@text milestone 1 are still open in baby_mobs.md 7.
